OL,3,AEdinburgh Academy pupils suffered
OL,4,Adecades of 'dreadful abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils at Edinburgh Academy suffered
OL,7,Fdecades of "dreadful abuse", a report
OL,8,Fhas found.
OL,10,FLady Smith, who chairs the Scottish
OL,11,FChild Abuse Inquiry (SCAI), details
OL,12,Fmore than 40 years of sexual, physical,
OL,13,Fand emotional abuse at the school in
OL,14,Fher latest report.
OL,16,FShe says the school focused on
OL,17,Fprotecting its reputation and ignored
OL,18,Fcomplaints.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
