OL,3,AEdinburgh Academy pupils suffered
OL,4,Adecades of 'dreadful abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLady Smith also names four serial
OL,7,Fperpetrators of the abuse, including
OL,8,Ftwo who went on to offend at other
OL,9,Fschools.
